gaox(){return"Skapers\xf8k organizes your items kind of like the folders on your computer, with some items inside other items. But in skapers\xf8k we dont have files and folders, we have \u2728the crate\u2728 \n \n Each blue box in the image represents a crate, as you can see they can contain other crates, but do not have to. Everything is a crate, which makes skapers\xf8k endlessly flexible! \ud83d\ude0a"},
